# Every file byte for byte on every host: no line ending converted at checkout. What the
# binary carries (include_bytes!, include_str!), what tests hold to oracles and what is
# vendored (held to its upstream's bytes, scripts/vendor-crate --check) must be the bytes
# their digests and answers were taken of; a Windows checkout's CRLF made the carried TUF
# target 6,913 bytes where targets.json pins its 6,787 and their sha256.
* -text
# Byte-exact test archives.
*.tar binary
